Characters 1-2: enter a piece square (e.g. d2), then Enter.
Every move requires a preview followed by F + Enter.
Other commands: restart, quit, claim, resign
White - enter START square (characters 1-2): COMPARE BEGIN White DEPTH 2 CANDIDATES e2e4 d2d4
NOTE measurements only: no weights, no move is chosen or played; STRONGER-CONDITION compares the strength of one stated condition, not the quality of a move
NOTE the same side to move, one depth (2) and one goal for every candidate, so every condition is measured under the same terms
CANDIDATE e2e4
FACT R-COUNT White U1 3 U2 2 U3 2 GAINED 12 RESTORED 0 OPENED 5
FACT R-COUNT Black U1 6 U2 0 U3 0 GAINED 0 RESTORED 0 OPENED 0
FACT CHECK none
FACT MATE1 White none
FACT MATE1 Black none
FACT LINKS PROTECT+ 0 PROTECT- 4 ATTACK+ 0 ATTACK- 0
FACT THREAT White none
FACT REPLIES 20 STOPS 0 LEAVES 0 NO-THREAT 20 ALLOWS 0
FACT LOOP NOT-FOUND MATED White 0 Black 0 LIMIT 2
FACT CAPTURE none
FACT MATERIAL -
FACT VALUE-ORDER none
FACT SQUARES-ORDER 2 ELSE
FACT GROUP 2 DISTANCE ELSE
VIEW LOOP-1 SQUARES 2 ORDER ELSE STOP e4 EMPTY
VIEW LOOP-2 VALUE none ORDER none MATERIAL -
NEURON-STATE UNDEFINED
CANDIDATE d2d4
FACT R-COUNT White U1 3 U2 2 U3 1 GAINED 10 RESTORED 0 OPENED 4
FACT R-COUNT Black U1 6 U2 0 U3 0 GAINED 0 RESTORED 0 OPENED 0
FACT CHECK none
FACT MATE1 White none
FACT MATE1 Black none
FACT LINKS PROTECT+ 0 PROTECT- 3 ATTACK+ 0 ATTACK- 0
FACT THREAT White none
FACT REPLIES 20 STOPS 0 LEAVES 0 NO-THREAT 20 ALLOWS 0
FACT LOOP NOT-FOUND MATED White 0 Black 0 LIMIT 2
FACT CAPTURE none
FACT MATERIAL -
FACT VALUE-ORDER none
FACT SQUARES-ORDER 2 ELSE
FACT GROUP 2 DISTANCE ELSE
VIEW LOOP-1 SQUARES 2 ORDER ELSE STOP d4 EMPTY
VIEW LOOP-2 VALUE none ORDER none MATERIAL -
NEURON-STATE UNDEFINED
PAIR e2e4 d2d4
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 R-COUNT-White U1 3 U2 2 U3 2 GAINED 12 RESTORED 0 OPENED 5 | U1 3 U2 2 U3 1 GAINED 10 RESTORED 0 OPENED 4 DIFFERENT
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 R-COUNT-Black U1 6 U2 0 U3 0 GAINED 0 RESTORED 0 OPENED 0 | U1 6 U2 0 U3 0 GAINED 0 RESTORED 0 OPENED 0 SAME
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 CHECK none | none SAME
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 MATE1-White none | none SAME
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 MATE1-Black none | none SAME
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 LINKS 0 4 0 0 | 0 3 0 0 DIFFERENT
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 THREAT White none | White none SAME
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 REPLIES 20 STOPS 0 LEAVES 0 NO-THREAT 20 ALLOWS 0 | 20 STOPS 0 LEAVES 0 NO-THREAT 20 ALLOWS 0 SAME
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 LOOP-MATED MATED White 0 Black 0 | MATED White 0 Black 0 SAME
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 LOOP NOT-FOUND | NOT-FOUND TIE
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 MATERIAL - | - NOT-COMPARABLE
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 CAPTURE none | none SAME
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 VALUE-ORDER none | none NOT-COMPARABLE
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 SQUARES-ORDER 2 ELSE | 2 ELSE SAME-ORDER-LEVEL
COMPARE e2e4 d2d4 GROUP 2 ELSE | 2 ELSE SAME-ORDER-LEVEL
AGREEMENT e2e4 d2d4 ALL-TIE
VIEWS e2e4 d2d4 LOOP-1 SAME-LEVEL LOOP-2 NOT-COMPARABLE NOT-COMPARABLE
COMPARE END

